#!/bin/sh
# Stand-in for swiftc while tools/coverage.sh runs the app tests: the same build with coverage on, and a copy of each
# test program for llvm-cov. The real swiftc is found on the PATH from before this folder was put in front.
OUT=""; PREV=""
for A in "$@"; do [ "$PREV" = -o ] && OUT=$A; PREV=$A; done
REAL=$(PATH=$TILT_COVERAGE_PATH command -v swiftc) || { echo "coverage: no swiftc" >&2; exit 1; }
"$REAL" "$@" -profile-generate -profile-coverage-mapping || exit $?
case "$OUT" in
  ""|*.o) ;;
  *) [ -f "$OUT" ] && cp "$OUT" "$TILT_COVERAGE_OUT/bin/$(basename "$OUT")" ;;
esac
exit 0
